   "body": "/claim mac/M1\n\n- `/api/…` hrefs answer 404 (`R57h`, #355), so the lists are asked as `rest_api.php?uri=forums/hardwarefr/categories/<id>/subcategories/` for categories 1, 2 and 10: logged out, then as user1 (read-only GETs, at least 60 s apart).\n- Publish the logged-out lists, and the logged-in ones only if they differ; MANIFEST rows, `check --corpus` and `--config`, `manifest_check.py`, an independent grep.\n- Compare each list with R57a's counts and with the sub-forum bar of the HTML category page that `SubforumInjection` / legacy `ObjCForumsParser.m` read; record it in HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-057. One draft PR, `Closes #285`, `Claim: mac/M1`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
